; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Hawaiian / ʻŌlelo Hawaiʻi (haw)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

neʻe counter 5

launch_loop:
kāhea_ʻōnaehana counter
kāpae counter 1
hoʻohālike counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
neʻe box 999
kāhea_ʻōnaehana box
